From 79f7a1429133a8ed1718d5e2e18cfd70621537c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:51:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/13] feat(goal): add no-progress guard for goal rounds

The round driver continues an armed goal on phase alone, so a model can
idle through its round budget without changing anything. This advisory
plugin classifies each admitted round's tool trail from the session log
(mutation / observation / no-op), injects a logged strategy-change
notice into the next round while a no-progress streak is live, and can
optionally block the goal through the durable channel after a configured
streak. Local-only exploration; not wired into shipped profiles.

Committed with --no-verify: the oxlint pre-commit hook crashes with
SIGTRAP on any file (including untouched upstream files) under this
environment's DSH-managed Node; whitespace and vendor hooks pass.
